WEBVTT

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:15.390
I, My, Me! Strawberry-eggs

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.880
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:12.910
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:40.820
Take that!

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.060
You're pretty good!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.670
What are you doing?!

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:54.140
Really, can't you even perform
your cleaning duties properly?!

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:03.050
Over there!
Remove that filthy thing!

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:03.900
Quickly!

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:07.860
How dare you?!

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:15.360
She is the founder of this school,
Himemiko Sannomiya-sensei!

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:17.900
Use the special cleaning net!

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.150
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:20.970
What kind of answer is that?!

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.410
You're kidding me, Shiro.

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:23.810
No, I'm not.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:24.570
See you.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:25.280
Yeah.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:27.850
Hey, sorry I'm late.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:28.630
Oops...

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.180
You're Shiro Naruo.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.080
Why are you late for this
important cleaning duty?

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.920
Come on, let's just clean.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:42.220
Really, you can never
take your eyes off men.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:43.460
True.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:57.450
8th Period
Rebellious Eyelash-Curler Boys

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.150
It's definitely wrong!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.170
Why only the male students?

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:10.960
All the students,
regardless of the gender...

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.000
should be given the cleaning tasks.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:17.140
If it is merely a matter of cleaning,
then we do not need the students.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.650
We have a professional
cleaning crew on contract.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.100
So the male students should
not have to do it, either.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:28.330
What's important is for them to learn
something through the act of cleaning.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:29.970
Precisely.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:34.740
It is necessary for them to develop
what little reason power they can.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.660
So why only the males?!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:41.000
Amawa-sensei, why do you
stand up for them so much?

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:44.270
If you will, think about
the men around you.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.750
How many of them are respectable?

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.020
Stay away!!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:01.760
Well, I'm just saying men are
human beings, just like women.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.550
That is an idealistic theory.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.120
Men will take advantage of any
leniency if we let them.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:08.350
But!

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:16.890
Give it here.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:20.520
Thank you.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.620
Why are you doing this?

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:29.830
Hibiki-sensei thinks we girls
should do the cleaning, too.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:32.540
I thought she might be right, so...

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:38.870
I'd say don't go overboard.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.020
Thanks, Fukae-kun.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.220
It seems he dislikes
me for some reason.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:55.750
We'll be janitors till
the day we graduate.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.860
The Principal
and the Vice-Principal...

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.520
look at us like we're
vermin or something.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:04.970
Hey, why don't we try
boycotting all the cleaning tasks?

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.250
Oh, good idea!

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.740
Let's do it.
When should we start?

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.490
That's not good.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.950
School policies should
always be observed.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.750
Besides, I'm afraid
we'd get in trouble.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.280
So what?
I'm not afraid.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:20.760
It's because of guys like you,
that they're imposing.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:22.820
What?

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.730
Boycotting the cleaning
won't change a thing.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.850
What is this?
Even you're giving up, Akira?

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.470
No way. Just wait.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.860
It really has to be changed somehow.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.100
The boys are oppressed...

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:40.640
and the girls will have a
distorted view of the male gender.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.940
Gender discrimination always
exists no matter where you go.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:45.070
Unacceptable.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.010
At least in school,
they must be completely equal.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:53.250
Well, if anybody can change
that Principal, it would be you.

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:55.100
Oh, nothing.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.170
By the way,
you're getting paid tomorrow.

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:59.940
I assume you can
pay the rent this time?

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:01.230
No worries.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.170
There's nothing left to buy this month.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.870
I could even pay for the next month.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:08.370
Kura-ge, you won't
be a hostage anymore.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:12.400
Too bad there'll be no
dog-nabe, though.

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:24.980
Thank you for your hard work.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:25.230
Salary

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.850
Please keep it up next month.

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:34.690
I mean, why don't they
do direct deposit?

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.360
Hibiki Amawa!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.790
Yes! Yes, yes!

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:42.730
One "yes" is sufficient.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:43.660
Yes!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.560
Thank you for your hard work.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:47.560
Thanks.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:55.520
2-Indigo

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:55.400
Oh, it's a nice day, isn't it?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.520
Why is she in such a good mood?

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.780
Because it's payday.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.110
So that's it.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:03.960
OK, the attendance...

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.270
Where is it?

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.420
Oh, I forgot to bring my roll book!!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.080
Her head's still in the clouds.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:11.910
Yeah.

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.620
Who's on day duty today?

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.640
Sorry, but can you please
go get it for me?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.070
What?

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.700
Please!

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.310
Excuse me.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.460
Oh, nobody's here.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:24.670
Let's see.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.460
Oh, here's her desk.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.180
What a mess.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.600
This is a woman's desk?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.250
Which one is the roll book?

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.190
Here it comes, Fuko!

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:02.460
Fuko!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.960
Are you OK, Kuzuha?!

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.310
Yes, I guess.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.500
Shiro Naruo of the
Second year Indigo class...

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.240
report to the guidance
counselor's office immediately.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.840
The guidance counselor's office?

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.600
Naruo, did something happened?

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.530
What?! A salary envelope is missing?!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.840
Guidance Counselor's Office

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.980
An unprecedented scandal since
the foundation of this school!

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:33.970
But what does it
have to do with Naruo?

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:37.500
The counselor tells me that he
maintains a rebellious attitude.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:40.000
And won't answer
any of her questions.

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:44.230
You'd become angry too if you were
treated as a thief so abruptly!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.340
Is there any proof?

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:50.430
I saw him coming out
of the faculty room, alone.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:51.600
What?!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.670
But that's because I made
him go get the roll book.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:56.100
It's just a coincidence.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:59.310
Yes, and perhaps he
saw my desk by coincidence.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.190
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:04.350
What?

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:05.830
What's that!?

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.910
Horrible, isn't it?

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.240
Where is Shiro Naruo's desk?!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.590
Shiro Naruo's behavior has
always been rather problematic.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:21.410
You suspect him based only on that?

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:23.300
Do you need any other reason?

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.300
I asked you a question!

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:29.800
You're going to search his desk?

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.800
Already treating him like a criminal?

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:35.010
His behavior urges us to believe so!

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:36.280
Behavior...

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:39.540
You mean Naruo isn't the good boy
faculty members like.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.270
It is a sufficient enough reason!

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.360
What if there's nothing in his desk?

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.220
Once we've checked, we'll know.
Now, tell me where it is!

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:50.560
Otherwise, you will be equally guilty!!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.540
This is utter nonsense!!
Principal...

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:01.210
what's the meaning of that
"Love is All" you always uphold?!

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.460
To love the students
is to trust them!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:06.860
Amawa-sensei, you are being
disrespectful to the Principle.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.210
Hibiki-sensei, we have a problem!

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:10.960
What are you doing here?!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.220
The boys!

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:18.160
Heave ho! Heave ho!
Heave ho! Heave ho!

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.060
Equal Rights for Men and Women

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.860
We stand firm!!

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:30.320
No thanks

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:30.320
Abolition of Gender Discrimination

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:30.350
Equal Rights for Men and Women

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:30.350
We stand
firm!!

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.360
Sensei! Look!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:57.550
Testing, testing.
One, two, three, testing.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.560
Those brats...

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.060
My grandmother's bronze bust!

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:07.630
We, the male students of the
2nd year Indigo class...

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:09.620
demand the following of the Principal!

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:12.820
One: Stop suspecting
Shiro Naruo and apologize!

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:17.320
Two: Treat men and women equally!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.300
Three: Hire some male kyoshi!!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.820
If these demands aren't satisfied...

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:28.510
we can not guarantee
the safety of this bust!

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.460
Hurry! Hurry!
Rescue my grandmother!

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:34.660
Guys!

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:38.340
I understand how you feel,
but don't resort to violence!

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.690
It is not violence!
It's a protest for justice!!

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:42.980
What's happening?!

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:45.550
Hurry up! Take them into custody!

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.850
Stay away!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.110
No!!

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:52.010
Grandmother!
My grandmother!!

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.310
Principal!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:54.210
Get back!

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:55.580
Get back now!

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:56.110
Yes.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.260
I knew it, stupid males...

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:09.900
Stupid males...

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:12.800
Principal, this is
a perfect opportunity...

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:14.710
to get rid of the
savage male students.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:18.230
We shall call in
the Director tomorrow...

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:21.230
and show him how these
males demoralize the school.

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:23.540
And if possible, expel them all.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.190
Wait a moment, please!

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:26.430
Amawa-sensei!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:29.810
This is all because you
have been spoiling them!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.410
Please send all the students
home that are not involved.

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:36.090
The school will be temporarily
closed tomorrow.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.820
If you are in charge of a class...

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:40.510
please send your
students home immediately.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.890
They're not gonna
get away with this.

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.680
Could they be expelled?

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:51.390
It is possible.
Committing such acts.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:54.570
They are staying the
night at school, right?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.210
What are they going
to do about dinner?

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.070
They won't even think about that.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.960
But they'll be hungry.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.090
Yeah, yeah, you're right.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.960
But it's lucky for us
to get a day off from school.

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:06.040
Right, Fujio?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:08.260
Uh, yeah.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:22.570
But I never dreamed you'd
take part in this, class president.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:26.620
Hearing Fukae with the guidance
counselor made my blood boil.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.500
I was here without
even thinking about it.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.310
Now that we've begun this,
we'll finish it right.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.090
We won't budge till
they accept our demands!

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.150
But what about food?

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:44.550
Equal Rights for Men and Women
We stand firm!!

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:42.970
It's a good opportunity.
You can be on a diet!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:49.660
A way to stop them,
stop them, stop them...

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:52.290
Can't think of anything!

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.750
I've always had more
muscles than brains.

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:21.100
Hello.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:22.230
Naruo?

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:22.820
Akira.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:27.260
How's it going?

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.030
The Principal and Vice-Principal...

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.380
it serves them right, huh?

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.270
We won't stop until
they apologize to you.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.300
We'll clear your
name no matter what...

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.180
and make the Principal admit her false accusation.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.210
Akira...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.290
Now that we've started,
we'll go all-out.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:45.530
We'll keep in touch.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:46.670
Bye.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.440
It's scary.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:04.320
The school at night is always scary.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:12.850
No please!! No please!
No please! Mom, help!

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:14.010
Kuzuha.

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:20.420
What are you doing here?

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.850
Ah... eh... well, um...

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.850
I thought you guys might be hungry.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.690
They're not the best
looking rice-balls, but...

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:34.990
Idiot.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.820
If you do things like this...

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.460
they're going to think
you're one of us.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.700
Is it bad if they do?

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:42.850
Of course!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.110
Don't you understand
what's going on?

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:47.580
Oh, am I being a nuisance?
I'm sorry.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.810
I guess you dislike me
even more now.

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:53.430
Don't be stupid.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:54.720
That's not true.

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:56.810
I don't dislike you at all.

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.230
Kuzuha...

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:04.010
Yes?

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.130
Naruo-kun?

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:24.930
Naruo!

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.810
Hibiki-chan. I'm sorry.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:30.580
The Vice-Principal's salary...

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:32.670
I hid it.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.470
Salary

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.300
I saw it when I went
to get the roll book.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:42.260
But I didn't do it for money.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:46.920
I just hid it because I wanted to give
the Vice-Principal a little trouble.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:47.850
Naruo!

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:49.520
Akira...

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:53.010
You bastard!

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.250
Hold on, Fukae!

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:56.940
Naruo, give it to me first.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.460
I don't have it.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:03.040
As I said, I just hid it
between the papers over there.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:07.620
That's... a discarded paper box.

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:12.370
I'll tell the Principal.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:13.340
No!

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:16.490
They started the protest
because they believed in you!

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.540
Without a valid reason things will

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.770
turn out just
like the Vice-Principal wants!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:21.580
But...

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.970
I don't want anyone
punished in this matter.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.190
OK, I'll deal with the salary.

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:33.250
But Fukae, you guys withdraw
your demands for the time being.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.080
I will figure something out.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.180
Hibiki-chan...

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:44.120
OK then, I have some jobs
for all three of you now.

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.510
Equal Rights for Men and Women
We stand firm!!

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.220
Guys...

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:00.250
I'm sorry.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:04.020
Gochiso

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.500
This being the case...

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.280
we need your help, Ba-chan!

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:06.950
All right.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:12.890
Is everybody ready?

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:16.540
You are to capture all the
dissidents without mercy, please.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:20.130
Vice-Principal, what do
you mean by a protest?

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:22.590
You'll see if you come with me.

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:23.580
Huh?

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:25.940
Alright, let's go, everybody.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:28.770
Transform!!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:29.390
Huh?!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.570
What on earth are you guys?!

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.060
I'm Ultra Mask the first!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.110
I'm the thirteenth!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.880
Just shut up and keep
them busy for a while.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.220
Roger!

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:40.880
Reflector Beam!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.980
Kochi-chan kick!

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:46.340
What the?

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:50.430
Police!
Someone call the police!!

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.100
Right!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:54.000
The school will not be closed today.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:56.840
Please circulate the message
down the student list.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.880
Oh, I have to wake up
everyone in the dorm, too.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.090
We're already up.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.270
We just need to
go to school, right?

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:06.450
Lost a day off, huh?

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:08.640
You guys...

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:09.710
Salary

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.230
What is this?

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.000
I happened to find it.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.610
So it was the males of the
Indigo class, after all.

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:21.940
At any rate, please
consider the matter settled.

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:24.470
For that, I will make them
give up the protest.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:26.410
But that is not...

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.130
You are the one who caused all this.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:32.890
It was your stupid
prejudice towards men!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.760
Stupid prejudice?

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.660
I am trying to guide them into the right direction.

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.970
You are merely pushing
your values on them.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.660
That's not an education!
Absolutely not!

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:58.400
Director...

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.610
Please look at this.

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:03.100
The wretched status of the
distinguished Seitow Private School!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.100
Stop it.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:15.870
How about this?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.530
I'm sorry, Makoto.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:26.790
Vice-Principal, where is
the protest you spoke of?

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:28.990
But... this can't be...

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:31.350
You must be getting old,
Vice-Principal.

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:36.040
It can't be.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:41.320
My, my.
Being alarmed for no reason.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:44.100
Well, I'll go home and back to bed.

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.680
Thanks to you, Ba-chan,
we were in time.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:52.090
But you had to give up all your pay
and borrow whatever was short.

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:55.780
Well, a cheap price to pay
considering nobody was punished.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:57.500
Nobody, huh?

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:58.950
Oh, nothing.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:20:59.400
Cell 3

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:10.370
Kaitaku Police Station

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:06.320
How did we end up here, Kochi-san?

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:05.160
Aww!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.160
Don't know.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:16.790
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:16.790
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:26.150
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:26.150
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:48.110
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:48.110
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:55.000
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:55.000
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:55.150 --> 00:22:01.850
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:55.150 --> 00:22:01.850
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:09.830
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:09.830
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:16.960
Even if the sky cries

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:16.960
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:25.800
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:25.800
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:53.440
9th Period A Midsummer Night's Sexy Gloss

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:41.150
OK, the Principal is
joining the homeroom today.

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:42.860
Would you like to conduct it?

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:44.870
Are you expecting me
to do a comic act!?

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:47.030
Ah, no, our homeroom isn't for...

00:22:47.030 --> 00:22:50.670
The fence around the garden
next door was completed.

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:52.770
That was cool...
